                                    <h2>Miktek PMD4</h2>
                    
                    <h2 class="sub">                    4-Mic Set</h2>
                    <p>The PMD4 is a 4-mic set of drum kit mics. It contains three of Miktek&#8217;s PM10 dynamics for toms and snare, and one PM11 for kick drum. All four mics have integrated hard mounts; the PM10s include detachable rim clamps for mounting on snare and tom hoops.</p><p>Both the PM10 and PM11 use a custom-designed capsule with a frequency response contoured for drum reproduction. Both use output transformers from AMI.</p><p>The kit ships in a padded aluminum flightcase.<br /><div class="shaft" style="padding-right:2em"><iframe width="120" scrolling="no" height="450" frameborder="0" style="border:none;" border="0" src="http://mer54715.datafeedfile.com/widget/aff_widget_prdt_generate-2.0.php?aff_num=9797&amp;aff_net=1&amp;widget_num=846" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0"></iframe></div><p>Permalink: <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/Miktek/PMD4">Miktek PMD4</a></p>                    
